{
"content_id": "765073",
"reference_id": 203216,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Zaburi za Sifa",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "zaburi za sifa",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Kichwa cha Kiebrania cha kitabu cha Zaburi kinamaanisha &quot;Sifa.&quot; Wazo hili linaendana na Zaburi nyingi, ambazo zinamsifu Mungu kwa asili yake na matendo yake makuu katika uumbaji na historia. Watu waliandika Zaburi za sifa kwa matumizi ya kibinafsi na ya kijamii.</p><p><em>Sifa za mtu binafsi</em> (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps9:1-Ps9:20\">Zaburi 9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps18:1-Ps18:50\">18</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps32:1-Ps32:11\">32</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps34:1-Ps34:22\">34</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps116:1-Ps116:19\">116</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps138:1-Ps138:8\">138</a>): Katika ibada ya hekalu, watu mara nyingi walitoa shukrani kwa sauti mbele ya wote walipotoa nadhiri au sadaka ya shukrani (tazama, kwa mfano, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps22:22-Ps22:26\">22:22–26</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps66:13-Ps66:20\">66:13–20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps116:17-Ps116:19\">116:17–19</a>). Nyakati hizi za sifa za kibinafsi na ushuhuda ziliongeza joto na maana katika ibada. Kila uokoaji na uzoefu wa rehema za Mungu ulikuwa sehemu ya hadithi inayoendelea ya wokovu. Ibada ilikuwa zaidi ya kukumbuka tu matendo ya Mungu ya zamani.</p><p><em>Sifa za pamoja</em> (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:1-Ps103:22\">Zaburi 103</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps113:1-Ps113:9\">113</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps124:1-Ps124:8\">124</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps129:1-Ps129:8\">129</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps136:1-Ps136:26\">136</a>): Wakati jamii ilipokusanyika, waliimba kumsifu Bwana kwa matendo yake ya kihistoria (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:1-Ps103:22\">Zaburi 103</a>). Au wangeweza kumsifu kwa onyesho la hivi karibuni la rehema yake (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps124:1-Ps124:8\">Zaburi 124</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps129:1-Ps129:8\">129</a>).</p><p>Kwenye <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:1-Ps103:22\">Zaburi 103</a>, mtunga zaburi anamsifu Mungu kwa rehema zake kwa watu binafsi na jamii nzima (mistari <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:1-Ps103:5\">1–5,</a> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:6-Ps103:14\">6–14</a>). Udhaifu wa binadamu unalinganishwa na uaminifu wa Mungu (mistari <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:15-Ps103:18\">15–18</a>). Utawala wake wa kipekee na wa ulimwengu wote unastahili sifa kutoka kwa kila mtu na kila kitu (mistari <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:19-Ps103:22\">19–22</a>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps9:1-Ps9:20\">Zaburi 9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps18:1-Ps18:50\">18</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps32:1-Ps32:11\">32</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps34:1-Ps34:22\">34</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps46:1-Ps48:14\">46–48</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps93:1-Ps93:5\">93</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps96:1-Ps99:9\">96–99</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps103:1-Ps103:22\">103</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps113:1-Ps113:9\">113</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps116:1-Ps116:19\">116</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps124:1-Ps124:8\">124</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps129:1-Ps129:8\">129</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps136:1-Ps136:26\">136</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps138:1-Ps138:8\">138</a></p>",
